WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,080
After using the group beads card, you can create a small faction of ten people

2
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:05,600
As the group owner, you have the right to invite and propose

3
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:07,040
Ban any survivor

4
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:08,560
Even without establishing a small faction

5
00:00:08,560 --> 00:00:11,540
We can also exchange information with each other to confirm

6
00:00:12,050 --> 00:00:18,480
What Mo Shi is most afraid of is information abuse and sex hugs

7
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:19,720
Use bead cards

8
00:00:19,880 --> 00:00:23,000
What he said when he pulled the five of them into the group, Little Prince Stovetop.

9
00:00:27,910 --> 00:00:29,670
I can also meet in the group chat when I go

10
00:00:29,670 --> 00:00:31,870
Why doesn’t my operation panel have this function?

11
00:00:31,870 --> 00:00:33,470
It should be that special props have been released.

12
00:00:33,470 --> 00:00:34,630
Just the six of us

13
00:00:35,350 --> 00:00:36,510
Mom, I'm out

14
00:00:36,750 --> 00:00:38,830
He actually got into the boss's inner circle

15
00:00:38,830 --> 00:00:40,550
Brothers, who is a smoker?

16
00:00:40,550 --> 00:00:42,910
I've been pestering you for six days and I'm about to die.

17
00:00:42,910 --> 00:00:44,150
Taoist school king fish shop a smoke

18
00:00:44,150 --> 00:00:45,110
Thanks brother

19
00:00:45,110 --> 00:00:46,870
Do you need vehicle vitality card fragments?

20
00:00:46,870 --> 00:00:49,070
The one that just opened a minute ago is no longer needed.

21
00:00:49,070 --> 00:00:50,870
Thanks to the Poisonous Gu Boss, I'm already at Level 2

22
00:00:50,870 --> 00:00:52,630
The young master in clothes asked the little prince on the stove

23
00:00:52,630 --> 00:00:54,510
Delivered a seafood 18-glass set

24
00:00:54,670 --> 00:00:56,790
I'm running out of fish and risking my life

25
00:00:56,790 --> 00:00:58,150
I snatched back a bronze box

26
00:00:58,150 --> 00:00:59,990
When you open it, it's like a set of eighteen seafood racks.

27
00:00:59,990 --> 00:01:01,310
If I could stomach it, I would admit it.

28
00:01:01,310 --> 00:01:02,950
But this thing is still raw

29
00:01:02,950 --> 00:01:05,670
You actually despise such a good thing
